invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: make writes CH_POLY1305_IFMA_MODEL for every host object, so
  poly1305_ifma.c would read test/poly1305_ifma_model_lanes.h, the
  portable model of each instruction, in place of the AVX-512
  instructions, and a session with CH_CPU_AVX512_IFMA would run test code
  that no library build may hold. test/widemul-builds.sh refuses a host
  object's defines that name it.

--- old
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF))
--- new
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF) $(if $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),-DCH_POLY1305_IFMA_MODEL))
